<http://data.silknow.org/object/06ccfe46-0ec0-3ad0-9af2-67b8418bd8a8/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Linen skirt dress with a floral border embroidered in blue silk. The name of the embroiderer 'Maria Papadopoula' and the date '1757' are included in the border. A tuck has been put into the garment to shorten it, so it is now skirt length. The shoulder straps are still attached and the bust is gathered. In Cretan feather, fishbone, satin, chain, back, double running and whipped stitches and French knots. Frieze of alternating vases of flowers. Made up of five loom widths of linen and cotton"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/06ccfe46-0ec0-3ad0-9af2-67b8418bd8a8> .

<http://data.silknow.org/image/853a661f-37bd-39a0-a3d5-9208602924cf>
